Lex["15"] = "agathopoieo {ag-ath-op-oy-eh'-o}|AV - do good 7, well doing 2, do well 2; 11|from 17|TDNT - 1:17,3|verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to do good, do something which profits othersINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> to be a good help to someoneINDENT3-- <b>b)</b> to do someone a favourINDENT3-- <b>c)</b> to benefitINDENT0--<b>2)</b> to do well, do right<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br />ἀγαθοποιέω agathopoi&#xE9;&#x14D;, ag-ath-op-oy-eh&#39;-o; from Strong\'s<a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=17&page=1\"> G17</a>; to be a well-doer (as a favor or a duty):&#8212;(when) do good, (well).";
