Lex["23"] = "aganakteo {ag-an-ak-teh'-o}|AV - have indignation 2, be much displeased 2, with indignation 2,<BR> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;be sore displeased 1; 7|from agan (much) and achthos (grief, akin to the base of 43)||verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to be indignant, moved with indignation, be very displeased<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br />ἀγανακτέω aganakt&#xE9;&#x14D;, ag-an-ak-teh&#39;-o; from &#x1F04;&#x3B3;&#x3B1;&#x3BD; &#xE1;gan (much) and &#x1F04;&#x3C7;&#x3B8;&#x3BF;&#x3C2; &#xE1;chthos (grief; akin to the base of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=43&page=1\">G43</a>); to be greatly afflicted, i.e. (figuratively) indignant:&#8212;be much (sore) displeased, have (be moved with, with) indignation.";
