Lex["212"] = "alazoneia {al-ad-zon-i'-a}|AV - boasting 1, pride 1; 2|from 213|TDNT - 1:226,36|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> empty, braggart talkINDENT0--<b>2)</b> an insolent and empty assurance, which trusts in its own power and resources and shamefully despises and violates divine laws and human rightsINDENT0--<b>3)</b> an impious and empty presumption which trusts in the stability of earthy things<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br />ἀλαζονεία alazone&#xED;a, al-ad-zon-i&#39;-a; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=213&page=1\">G213</a>; braggadocio, i.e. (by implication) self-confidence:&#8212;boasting, pride.";
