Lex["692"] = "argos {ar-gos'}|AV - idle 6, slow 1, barren 1; 8|from 1 (as a negative particle) and 2041|TDNT - 1:452,76|adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> free from labour, at leisureINDENT0--<b>2)</b> lazy, shunning the labour which one ought to perform<BR> <!--For Synonyms see entry 5814<br />--><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἀργός arg&#xF3;s, ar-gos&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=1&page=1\">G1</a> (as a negative particle) and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2041&page=1\">G2041</a>; inactive, i.e. unemployed; (by implication) lazy, useless:&#8212;barren, idle, slow.";
