Lex["694"] = "argurion {ar-goo'-ree-on}|AV - money 11, piece of silver 5, silver 3, silver piece 1; 20|neuter of a presumed derivative of 696||noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> silver<BR>INDENT0--<b>2)</b> moneyINDENT0--<b>3)</b> a silver coin, silver piece, a shekel<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἀργύριον arg&#xFD;rion, ar-goo&#39;-ree-on; neuter of a presumed derivative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=696&page=1\">G696</a>; silvery, i.e. (by implication) cash; specially, a silverling (i.e. drachma or shekel):&#8212;money, (piece of) silver (piece).";
