Lex["707"] = "Arimathaia {ar-ee-math-ah'-ee-ah}|AV - Arimathaea 4; 4|of Hebrew origin 07414||noun proper location| INDENT0--Arimathaea = \"heights\"<BR>INDENT0--<b>1)</b> the name of several cities in Palestine The one mentioned in Mat. 27:57, Mk 15:43, Lk. 23:51, Jn 19:38 appears to have been the same as the birthplace of Samuel in Mount Ephraim.<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> Ἀριμαθαία Arimatha&#xED;a, ar-ee-math-ah&#39;-ee-ah; of Hebrew origin (Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=H7414\">H7414</a>); Arimathæa (or Ramah), a place in Palestine:&#8212;Arimathæa.";
