Lex["765"] = "asebes {as-eb-ace'}|AV - ungodly 8, ungodly men 1; 9|from 1 (as a negative particle) and a presumed derivative of 4576|TDNT - 7:185,1010|adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> destitute of reverential awe towards God, condemning God, impious<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἀσεβής aseb&#x1E17;s, as-eb-ace&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=1&page=1\">G1</a> (as a negative particle) and a presumed derivative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4576&page=1\">G4576</a>; irreverent, i.e. (by extension) impious or wicked:&#8212;ungodly (man).";
