Lex["840"] = "austeros {ow-stay-ros'}|AV - austere 2; 2|from a (presumed) derivative of the same as 109 (meaning blown)||adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> of mind and manners: harsh, rough, rigid<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> αὐστηρός aust&#x113;r&#xF3;s, ow-stay-ros&#39;; from a (presumed) derivative of the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=109&page=1\">G109</a> (meaning blown); rough (properly as a gale), i.e. (figuratively) severe:&#8212;austere.";
