Lex["888"] = "achreios {akh-ri'-os}|AV - unprofitable 2; 2|from 1 (as a negative particle) and a derivative of 5534 [cf 5532]||adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> useless, good for nothing<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἀχρεῖος achre&#xEE;os, akh-ri&#39;-os; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=1&page=1\">G1</a> (as a negative particle) and a derivative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=5534&page=1\">G5534</a> (compare Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=5532&page=1\">G5532</a>); useless, i.e. (euphemistically) unmeritorious:&#8212;unprofitable.";
