Lex["928"] = "basanizo {bas-an-id'-zo}|AV - torment 8, pain 1, toss 1, vex 1, toil 1; 12|from 931|TDNT - 1:561,96|verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to test (metals) by the touchstone, which is a black siliceous stone used to test the purity of gold or silver by the colour of the streak produced on it by rubbing it with either metalINDENT0--<b>2)</b> to question by applying tortureINDENT0--<b>3)</b> to tortureINDENT0--<b>4)</b> to vex with grievous pains (of body or mind), to tormentINDENT0--<b>5)</b> to be harassed, distressedINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> of those who at sea are struggling with a head wind<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> βασανίζω basan&#xED;z&#x14D;, bas-an-id&#39;-zo; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=931&page=1\">G931</a>; to torture:&#8212;pain, toil, torment, toss, vex.";
