Lex["1053"] = "Galatia {gal-at-ee'-ah}|AV - Galatia 4; 4|of foreign origin||noun proper location| INDENT0--Galatia = \"land of the Galli, Gauls\"<BR>INDENT0--<b>1)</b> the Roman province of Galatia my be roughly described as the central region of the peninsula of Asia Minor, bounded on the north by Bithynia and Paphlagonia; on the east by Pontus; on the south by Cappadocia and Lycaonia; on the west by Phrygia<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> Γαλατία Galat&#xED;a, gal-at-ee&#39;-ah; of foreign origin; Galatia, a region of Asia:&#8212;Galatia.";
