Lex["2201"] = "zeugos {dzyoo'-gos}|AV - pair 1, yoke 1; 2|from the same as 2218||noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> two draught cattle (horses or mules or oxen) yoked together, a pair or yoke of beastsINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a pair<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ζεῦγος ze&#xFB;gos, dzyoo&#39;-gos; from the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2218&page=1\">G2218</a>; a couple, i.e. a team (of oxen yoked together) or brace (of birds tied together):&#8212;yoke, pair.";
