Lex["2238"] = "heduosmon {hay-doo'-os-mon}|AV - mint 2; 2|from the compound of the same as 2234 and 3744||noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> sweet smelling, garden mintINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> a kind of small odoriferous herb, with which the Jews used to scatter on the floors of their houses and synagogues<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἡδύοσμον h&#x113;d&#xFD;osmon, hay-doo&#39;-os-mon; neuter of the compound of the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2234&page=1\">G2234</a> and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=3744&page=1\">G3744</a>; a sweet-scented plant, i.e. mint:&#8212;mint.";
