Lex["2255"] = "hemisu {hay'-mee-soo}|AV - half 5; 5|neuter of a derivative from an inseparable pref. akin to 260 (through the idea of partition involved in connection) and meaning semi-||adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> half<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> <sup><a href=\"#strongs-legend\"><span style=\"font-size:150%\"><b>&dagger;</b></span></a></sup>ἥμισυ h&#x1E17;misy, hay&#39;-mee-soo; neuter of a derivative from an inseparable prefix akin to Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=260&page=1\">G260</a> (through the idea of partition involved in connection) and meaning semi-; (as noun) half:&#8212;half.";
