Lex["2258"] = "en {ane}|AV - was 267, were 115, had been 12, had 11, taught + 1321 4,<BR> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;stood + 2476 4, misc 42, vr was 1; 457|imperfect of 1510||verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> I was, etc.<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἦν &#x113;n, ane; imperfect of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=1510&page=1\">G1510</a>; I (thou, etc.) was (wast or were):&#8212;<sup><a href=\"#strongs-legend\"><b>X</b></span></a></sup>agree, be, X have (<sup><a href=\"#strongs-legend\"><b>X</b></span></a></sup>charge of), hold, use, was(-t), were.";
