Lex["2307"] = "thelema {thel'-ay-mah}|AV - will 62, desire 1, pleasure 1; 64|from the prolonged form of 2309|TDNT - 3:52,318|noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> what one wishes or has determined shall be doneINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> of the purpose of God to bless mankind through ChristINDENT3-- <b>b)</b> of what God wishes to be done by usINDENT7--<b>1)</b> commands, preceptsINDENT0--<b>2)</b> will, choice, inclination, desire, pleasure<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> θέλημα th&#xE9;l&#x113;ma, thel&#39;-ay-mah; from the prolonged form of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2309&page=1\">G2309</a>; a determination (properly, the thing), i.e. (actively) choice (specially, purpose, decree; abstractly, volition) or (passively) inclination:&#8212;desire, pleasure, will.";
