Lex["2337"] = "thelazo {thay-lad'-zo}|AV - give suck 4, suck 1, suckling 1; 6|from thele (the nipple)||verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to give the breast, give suck, to suckleINDENT0--<b>2)</b> to suck<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> θηλάζω th&#x113;l&#xE1;z&#x14D;, thay-lad&#39;-zo; from &#x3B8;&#x3B7;&#x3BB;&#x1F75; th&#x113;l&#x1E17; (the nipple); to suckle, (by implication) to suck:&#8212;(give) suck(-ling).";
