Lex["2339"] = "thera {thay'-rah}|AV - trap 1; 1|from ther (a wild animal, as game)||noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a hunting of wild beasts to destroy themINDENT0--<b>2)</b> metaph. of preparing destruction for men<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> θήρα th&#x1E17;ra, thay&#39;-rah; from &#x3B8;&#x1F75;&#x3C1; th&#x1E17;r (a wild animal, as game); hunting, i.e. (figuratively) destruction:&#8212;trap.";
Lex["2340"] = "thereuo {thay-ryoo'-o}|AV - catch 1; 1|from 2339||verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to go a hunting, to hunt, to catch in huntingINDENT0--<b>2)</b> metaph. to lay wait for, strive to ensnare, catch artfully<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> θηρεύω th&#x113;re&#xFA;&#x14D;, thay-ryoo&#39;-o; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2339&page=1\">G2339</a>; to hunt (an animal), i.e. (figuratively) to carp at:&#8212;catch.";
