Lex["2365"] = "thugatrion {thoo-gat'-ree-on}|AV - little daughter 1, young daughter 1; 2|from 2364||noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a little daughter<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> θυγάτριον thyg&#xE1;trion, thoo-gat&#39;-ree-on; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2364&page=1\">G2364</a>; a daughterling:&#8212;little (young) daughter.";
