Lex["2442"] = "himeiromai {him-i'-rom-ahee} or homeiromai {hom-i'rom-ahee}|AV - be affectionately desirous 1; 1|middle voice from himeros (a yearning, of uncertain affinity)|TDNT - 5:176,*|verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to desire, long for, esp. the longing of love<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> <sup><a href=\"#strongs-legend\"><span style=\"font-size:150%\"><b>&dagger;</b></span></a></sup>ἱμείρομαι hime&#xED;romai, him-i&#39;-rom-ahee; middle voice from &#x1F35;&#x3BC;&#x3B5;&#x3C1;&#x3BF;&#x3C2; h&#xED;meros (a yearning; of uncertain affinity); to long for:&#8212;be affectionately desirous.";
