Lex["2474"] = "Israel {is-rah-ale'}|AV - Israel 70; 70|of Hebrew origin 03478|TDNT - 3:356,372|adjective| INDENT0--Israel = \"he shall be a prince of God\"<BR>INDENT0--<b>1)</b> the name given to the patriarch Jacob (and borne by him in<BR> addition to his former name)INDENT0--<b>2)</b> the family or descendants of Israel, the nation of IsraelINDENT0--<b>3)</b> Christians, the Israel of God (Gal 6:16), for not all those who draw their bodily descent from Israel are true Israelites, i.e. are those whom God pronounces to be Israelites and has chosen to salvation<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> Ἰσραήλ Isra&#x1E17;l, is-rah-ale&#39;; of Hebrew origin (Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=H3478\">H3478</a>); Israel (i.e. Jisrael), the adopted name of Jacob, including his descendants (literally or figuratively):&#8212;Israel.";
