Lex["2479"] = "ischus {is-khoos'}|AV - strength 4, power 2, might 2, ability 1, mightily + 1722 1,<BR> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;mighty 1; 11|from a derivative of is (force, cf eschon, a form of 2192)|TDNT - 3:397,378|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> ability, force, strength, might<BR> <!--For Synonyms see entry 5820<br />--><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἰσχύς isch&#xFD;s, is-khoos&#39;; from a derivative of &#x1F30;&#x3C2; is (force; compare &#x1F14;&#x3C3;&#x3C7;&#x3BF;&#x3BD; &#xE9;schon, a form of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2192&page=1\">G2192</a>); forcefulness (literally or figuratively):&#8212;ability, might(-ily), power, strength.";
Lex["2480"] = "ischuo {is-khoo'-o}|AV - can (could) 9, be able 6, avail 3, prevail 3, be whole 2,<BR> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;cannot + 3756 1, can do 1, may 1, misc 3; 29|from 2479|TDNT - 3:397,378|verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to be strongINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> to be strong in body, to be robust, to be in sound healthINDENT0--<b>2)</b> to have powerINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> to have power as shown by extraordinary deedsINDENT7--<b>1)</b> to exert, wield power, to have strength to overcomeINDENT3-- <b>b)</b> to be a force, availINDENT3-- <b>c)</b> to be serviceableINDENT3-- <b>d)</b> to be able, can<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ἰσχύω isch&#xFD;&#x14D;, is-khoo&#39;-o; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2479&page=1\">G2479</a>; to have (or exercise) force (literally or figuratively):&#8212;be able, avail, can do(-not), could, be good, might, prevail, be of strength, be whole, <sup><a href=\"#strongs-legend\"><b>X</b></span></a></sup>much work.";
