Lex["3025"] = "lenos {lay-nos'}|AV - winepress 4, winepress + 3631 1; 5|apparently a primary word|TDNT - 4:254,531|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a tub or trough shaped receptacle, vat, in which grapes are troddenINDENT0--<b>2)</b> the lower vat, dug in the ground, into which the must or new wine flowed from the press<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ληνός l&#x113;n&#xF3;s, lay-nos&#39;; apparently a primary word; a trough, i.e. wine-vat:&#8212;winepress.";
