Lex["3140"] = "martureo {mar-too-reh'-o}|AV - bear witness 25, testify 19, bear record 13, witness 5,<BR> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;be a witness 2, give testimony 2, have a good report 2, misc 11; 79|from 3144|TDNT - 4:474,564|verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to be a witness, to bear witness, i.e. to affirm that one has seen or heard or experienced something, or that he knows it because taught by divine revelation or inspirationINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> to give (not to keep back) testimonyINDENT3-- <b>b)</b> to utter honourable testimony, give a good reportINDENT3-- <b>c)</b> conjure, implore<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> μαρτυρέω martyr&#xE9;&#x14D;, mar-too-reh&#39;-o; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=3144&page=1\">G3144</a>; to be a witness, i.e. testify (literally or figuratively):&#8212;charge, give (evidence), bear record, have (obtain, of) good (honest) report, be well reported of, testify, give (have) testimony, (be, bear, give, obtain) witness.";
