Lex["3198"] = "Melchisedek {mel-khis-ed-ek'}|AV - Melchisedec 9; 9|of Hebrew origin 04442|TDNT - 4:568,*|noun proper masculine| INDENT0--Melchizedek = \"king of righteousness\"<BR>INDENT0--<b>1)</b> the king of Salem and priest of the most high God, who lived in the days of Abraham<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> Μελχισεδέκ Melchised&#xE9;k, mel-khis-ed-ek&#39;; of Hebrew origin (Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=H4442\">H4442</a>); Melchisedek (i.e. Malkitsedek), a patriarch:&#8212;Melchisedec.";
