Lex["3804"] = "pathema {path'-ay-mah}|AV - suffering 11, affliction 3, affection 1, motion 1; 16|from a presumed derivative of 3806|TDNT - 5:930,798|noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> that which one suffers or has sufferedINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> externally, a suffering, misfortune, calamity, evil, afflictionINDENT7--<b>1)</b> of the sufferings of ChristINDENT7--<b>2)</b> also the afflictions which Christians must undergo in behalf of the same cause which Christ patiently enduredINDENT3-- <b>b)</b> of an inward state, an affliction, passionINDENT0--<b>2)</b> an enduring, undergoing, suffering<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> πάθημα p&#xE1;th&#x113;ma, path&#39;-ay-mah; from a presumed derivative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=3806&page=1\">G3806</a>; something undergone, i.e. hardship or pain; subjectively, an emotion or influence:&#8212;affection, affliction, motion, suffering.";
