Lex["3810"] = "paideutes {pahee-dyoo-tace'}|AV - instructor 1, which corrected 1; 2|from 3811|TDNT - 5:596,753|noun masculine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> an instructor, preceptor, teacherINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a chastiser<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> παιδευτής paideut&#x1E17;s, pahee-dyoo-tace&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=3811&page=1\">G3811</a>; a trainer, i.e. teacher or (by implication) discipliner:&#8212;which corrected, instructor.";
