Lex["4230"] = "pragmateia {prag-mat-i'-ah}|AV - affair 1; 1|from 4231|TDNT - 6:640,927|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> prosecution of any affairINDENT3-- <b>a)</b> business, occupation<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> πραγματεία pragmate&#xED;a, prag-mat-i&#39;-ah; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4231&page=1\">G4231</a>; a transaction, i.e. negotiation:&#8212;affair.";
