Lex["4316"] = "prosagoreuo {pros-ag-or-yoo'-o}|AV - call 1; 1|from 4314 and a derivative of 58 (mean to harangue)||verb|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to speak to, to address, accost, saluteINDENT0--<b>2)</b> esp. to address or accost by some name, call by nameINDENT0--<b>3)</b> to give a name in public, to style<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> προσαγορεύω prosagore&#xFA;&#x14D;, pros-ag-or-yoo&#39;-o; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4314&page=1\">G4314</a> and a derivative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=58&page=1\">G58</a> (mean to harangue); to address, i.e. salute by name:&#8212;call.";
