Lex["4398"] = "prophetis {prof-ay'-tis}|AV - prophetess 2; 2|from 4396|TDNT - 6:781,952|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a prophetessINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a woman to whom future events or things hidden from others are at times revealed, either by inspiration or by dreams and visionsINDENT0--<b>3)</b> a female who declares or interprets oracles<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> προφῆτις proph&#x113;tis, prof-ay&#39;-tis; feminine of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4396&page=1\">G4396</a>; a female foreteller or an inspired woman:&#8212;prophetess.";
