Lex["4444"] = "purgos {poor'-gos}|AV - tower 4; 4|apparently a primary word (\"burgh\")|TDNT - 6:953,980|noun masculine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a towerINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a fortified structure rising to a considerable height, to repel a hostile attack or to enable a watchman to see in every direction<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> πύργος p&#xFD;rgos, poor&#39;-gos; apparently a primary word ( \"burgh\"); a tower or castle:&#8212;tower.";
