Lex["4467"] = "rhadiourgema {hrad-ee-oorg'-ay-mah}|AV - lewdness 1; 1|from a comparative of rhaidios (easy, i.e. reckless) and 2041|TDNT - 6:972,983|noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a piece of knavery, rascality, villainy<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ῥᾳδιούργημα rhaidio&#xFA;rg&#x113;ma, hrad-ee-oorg&#39;-ay-mah; from a comparative of &#x1FE5;&#x1FB4;&#x3B4;&#x3B9;&#x3BF;&#x3C2; rh&#xE1;idios (easy, i.e. reckless) and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=2041&page=1\">G2041</a>; easy-going behavior, i.e. (by extension) a crime:&#8212;lewdness.";
