Lex["4469"] = "rhaka {rhak-ah'}|AV - Raca 1; 1|of Aramaic origin cf 07386|TDNT - 6:973,983|n|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> empty, i.e. a senseless, empty headed manINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a term of reproach used among the Jews in the time of Christ<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ῥακά rhak&#xE1;, rhak-ah&#39;; of Chaldee origin (compare Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=H7386\">H7386</a>); O empty one, i.e. thou worthless (as a term of utter vilification):&#8212;Raca.";
