Lex["4555"] = "sardinos {sar'-dee-nos}|AV - sardine 1; 1|from the same as 4556||adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a sardius, a precious stone of which there are two types, the former is called a carnelian (because flesh coloured) and the latter a sard<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> σάρδινος s&#xE1;rdinos, sar&#39;-dee-nos; from the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4556&page=1\">G4556</a>; sardine (Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=3037&page=1\">G3037</a> being implied), i.e. a gem, so called:&#8212;sardine.";
