Lex["4707"] = "spoudaioteros {spoo-dah-yot'-er-os}|AV - more forward 1, more diligent 1; 2|comparative of 4705||adjective|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> active, diligent, zealous, earnestINDENT0--<b>2)</b> very diligent<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> σπουδαιότερος spoudai&#xF3;teros, spoo-dah-yot&#39;-er-os; comparative of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4705&page=1\">G4705</a>; more prompt, more earnest:&#8212;more diligent (forward).";
