Lex["4807"] = "sukaminos {soo-kam'-ee-nos}|AV - sycamine tree 1; 1|of Hebrew origin 08256 in imitation of 4809|TDNT - 7:758,1100|noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> sycamine tree, having the form and foliage of the mulberry, but fruit resembling the fig<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> συκάμινος syk&#xE1;minos, soo-kam&#39;-ee-nos; of Hebrew origin (Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=H8256\">H8256</a>) in imitation of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4809&page=1\">G4809</a>; a sycamore-fig tree:&#8212;sycamine tree.";
