Lex["4988"] = "Sosthenes {soce-then'-ace}|AV - Sosthenes 2; 2|from the base of 4982 and that of 4599||noun proper masculine| INDENT0--Sosthenes = \"saviour of his nation\"<BR>INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a Jew at Corinth who was seized and beaten in the presence of GallioINDENT0--<b>2)</b> a certain Christian associate of Paul<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> Σωσθένης S&#x14D;sth&#xE9;n&#x113;s, soce-then&#39;-ace; from the base of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4982&page=1\">G4982</a> and that of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=4599&page=1\">G4599</a>; of safe strength; Sosthenes, a Christian:&#8212;Sosthenes.";
