Lex["5334"] = "phasis {fas'-is}|AV - tidings 1; 1|from 5346 (not the same as \"phase\", which is from 5316)||noun feminine|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> in the Attic orators, the exposure of (informing against) those who have embezzled the property of the state, or violated the laws respecting the importation or exporting of merchandise, or defrauded their wardsINDENT0--<b>2)</b> the disclosure of secret crime<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> φάσις ph&#xE1;sis, fas&#39;-is; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=5346&page=1\">G5346</a> (not the same as \"phase\", which is from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=5316&page=1\">G5316</a>); a saying, i.e. report:&#8212;tidings.";
