Lex["5596"] = "psomion {pso-mee'-on}|AV - sop 4; 4|diminutive from a derivative of the base of 5597||noun neuter|INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a fragment, bit, morsel<br /><BR /><hr />INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><br> ψωμίον ps&#x14D;m&#xED;on, pso-mee&#39;-on; diminutive from a derivative of the base of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_greek.html?strongs=5597&page=1\">G5597</a>; a crumb or morsel (as if rubbed off), i.e. a mouthful:&#8212;sop.";
